<title>CANADA: Bombardier Inc Q4 loss turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Bombardier Inc Q4 loss turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			   1996</p>
<p> Shr    Profit	   C$0.42     Loss	C$0.15</p>
<p> Net    Profit	    147.3     Loss	  49.9</p>
<p> Revs		   2,500,000		2,700,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     Profit	  C$1.16   Profit	C$0.45</p>
<p> Net     Profit	 406,200   Profit     158,000</p>
<p> Revs		   8,000,000		7,100,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 336,100		  333,000</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Quarter ended Jan 31. 1996 fourth quarter and year net income is after C$155 million write-down of investment in share units of Eurotunnel.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
